examples-advanced = Advanced

example-calculator-title = Calculator
example-calculator-desc = Two numbers, an operation chosen in a ComboBox, match on the selection, and a message box for division by zero.
example-color-title = Color picker
example-color-desc = Three sliders (red, green, blue) change the background color of a panel: ValueChanged events and the BackColor property.
example-quiz-title = Rust quiz
example-quiz-desc = A multiple-choice quiz with RadioButtons, a constant array of questions and a final score.
example-stopwatch-title = Stopwatch
example-stopwatch-desc = A Timer raises Tick every 100 ms: start, stop, reset and a progress bar for the seconds.
example-address-book-title = Address book
example-address-book-desc = A contact list; a second window (modal dialog) asks for the name and phone number.
example-tic-tac-toe-title = Tic-tac-toe
example-tic-tac-toe-desc = A two-player game with 9 buttons: board state, winner detection and a helper that returns a button by index.
example-notepad-title = Notepad
example-notepad-desc = A multiline text box, a File menu (New, Open, Save, Quit) and reading/writing a file with std::fs.

